I hate forgetting things, both in real life and in Nethack, especially
since a single mind flaying removed my memories of gold detection and
charging scrolls during a genoless endgame. I also hate forgetting
spells such as "sleep" that I use every ten seconds. My favorite
Slash'em feature is the spell system's "use it or lose it" feature
that reinforces memory of oft-used spells.

With that said, I propose the "Ring of Memory". Wearing it prevents
timeout of spells and protects from the amnesia (but not
brainlessness) induced by mind flayers and amnesia scrolls. If a
wizard or priest is willing to wear a ring of memory for half the game
rather than something like slow digestion or free action with *active*
effects, I think it's a fair trade.



